  "description": "At 8 years old, Viviane’s younger sister was already able to reproduce weapons and mechanics that only individuals considered geniuses could create. In addition to her knowledge of mechanics, she possessed beauty beyond compare. For this reason, she gained the title of Mech Beauty. Being of weak constitution, Gwenevere often relied on the medical abilities of her sister in order to stay in good health. For many years, she worked with her sister on different projects. Notably, they worked together on an armor that would allow one to travel through time. As time passed, her knowledge increased and she was chosen, to no surprise, as Queen of the Ancients. Her people were prosperous and happy throughout her reign. That was, until one fateful day. A powerful demon attacked the Kingdom of the Ancients. Being of a peaceful nature, they weren’t ready to respond. The demon ravaged the kingdom, slaying most of the Ancients and leaving the two sisters, Viviane and Gwenevere, for dead. Having lost her arm during the demon attack, Gwenevere made a prosthetic mechanical arm in order to replace the lost limb: a powerful cannon to take revenge on this being who had stolen everything away from her. During the years that followed, she undertook a long voyage to find out information on the demon. While wandering about, she saved a young soldier who was at death’s door. She developed a fondness for him, having survived a horrible battle during which he lost his arm, and she made a prosthetic mechanical arm for her new protégé.",
  "summon": "My knowledge will aid you in your quest, Summoner.",
  "fusion": "I will use this power to create even stronger machines.",
